OL,3,CGreater Manchester Mayoral contest:
OL,4,CWhat is the Supplementary Vote system?
OL,6,FITV Granada Reports' political
OL,7,Fcorrespondent Lise McNally explains
OL,8,Fthe Supplementary Vote (SV) system
OL,10,FMore than 2 million voters are gearing
OL,11,Fup for one of the biggest by-elections
OL,12,Fin political history.
OL,14,FOn Thursday 30th July, polls will open
OL,15,Facross all ten Greater Manchester
OL,16,Fboroughs, so people can choose who
OL,17,Fshould replace Andy Burnham as the
OL,18,Fregion's new Metro Mayor.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
