OL,3,CGreater Manchester Mayoral contest:
OL,4,CWhat is the Supplementary Vote system?
OL,6,FIt's a role with considerable devolved
OL,7,Fpowers - the Mayor represents the
OL,8,Fregion nationally and internationally,
OL,9,Fand is tasked with improving the
OL,10,Feveryday lives of people across
OL,11,FBolton, Bury, Manchester, Oldham,
OL,12,FRochdale, Salford, Stockport,
OL,13,FTameside, Trafford and Wigan.
OL,15,FThe policy areas they are in charge of
OL,16,Finclude transport, planning, the
OL,17,Fpolice, and driving economic growth.
OL,19,FHow will the new Mayor be elected?
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
