OL,3,CGreater Manchester Mayoral contest:
OL,4,CWhat is the Supplementary Vote system?
OL,6,FA voting system called the
OL,7,FSupplementary Vote (SV) will be in
OL,8,Fplace for the Greater Manchester
OL,9,Fmayoral election, as opposed to first
OL,10,Fpast the post, the system used for a
OL,11,Fgeneral election.
OL,13,FUnder the SV system, people will be
OL,14,Fable to vote for their preferred
OL,15,Fcandidate as usual, but there will be
OL,16,Fa second column on the ballot paper
OL,17,Fwhere voters can also pick a second
OL,18,Fchoice candidate if they choose.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
