OL,3,CGreater Manchester Mayoral contest:
OL,4,CWhat is the Supplementary Vote system?
OL,6,FDuring the first round of counting,
OL,7,Fonly the first choice votes will be
OL,8,Fcounted. If one candidate wins more
OL,9,Fthan 50% of the first preference
OL,10,Fvotes, they would win and become
OL,11,FGreater Manchester Mayor.
OL,13,FHowever, if no candidate gets that
OL,14,Fmajority, the count will move on to
OL,15,Fthe supplementary vote.
OL,17,FThe top two candidates will stay in
OL,18,Fthe running, all the others will be
OL,19,Feliminated, and those ballot papers
OL,20,Fwill be looked at again.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
