PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785223089
OL,3,CGreater Manchester Mayoral contest:
OL,4,CWhat is the Supplementary Vote system?
OL,6,FSome of the second preference votes
OL,7,Fwill be for candidates who have
OL,8,Falready been eliminated, they are
OL,9,Fdiscarded - but any votes for the two
OL,10,Ffrontrunners will be added to their
OL,11,Ffinal tally.
OL,13,FAfter the second round of counting,
OL,14,Fwhoever has the most votes will win,
OL,15,Fand become Greater Manchester Mayor.
OL,17,FWatch the Greater Manchester Mayoral
OL,18,Felection debate:
OL,20,FWho is standing to be Mayor of Greater
OL,21,FManchester?
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
